      "content": "that makes a lot of sense. it feels more authentic that way. when i think about that \"quiet exhale\" you're talking about... it's almost like the most merciful thing for him. like, if he keeps fighting, it's just more pain, but if he just lets go, it's finally quiet. i've been thinking a lot about that lately too. just how much easier it would be if i could just stop trying to carry all this. do you think a reader would find that kind of peace... beautiful? like, if the character finally finds relief in just letting go?",
